==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|sœtr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|swōtuz|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsaiːtʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aiːtʏr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|sætari|sætastur}}

# [[sweet]], [[saccharine]], [[sugary]]
#: ''[[eplasafi|Eplasafinn]] er mjög '''sætur'''.''
#:: The [[apple juice]] is really '''sweet'''.
# [[sweet]], [[nice]], [[kind]]
# [[cute]], [[pretty]]
#: ''Vinkona þín er svakalega '''sæt'''.''
#:: Your friend is really '''cute'''.

